OL,3,GNEWSAMan deliberately fell on Ipswich
OL,4,Afans, trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football fan deliberately threw
OL,7,Fhimself to a lower tier of a grandstand
OL,8,Fduring a match, a court heard.
OL,10,FMaidstone United supporter John Ryan is
OL,11,Faccused of falling from the upper tier
OL,12,Fon to a section of home supporters at
OL,13,FIpswich Town's Portman Road ground
OL,14,Fduring an FA Cup clash in January 2024.
OL,16,FThe 62-year-old of Rochester Street,
OL,17,FChatham, Kent denies two counts of
OL,18,Fassault by beating and one count of
OL,19,Factual bodily harm.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
