OL,4,Afans, trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpening the trial at Ipswich Crown
OL,7,FCourt, prosecutor Simon Gladwell told
OL,8,Fthe court Ryan had been intoxicated and
OL,9,Finjured a woman and a man in the lower
OL,10,Ftier.
